  /* Wrapper that holds the status badge + every task-scope chip for a
     row, fixed-width so cmd-desc starts at the same x across rows.
     justify-content: flex-end packs the contents against the right edge
     of the slot — any leftover space sits on the LEFT (between cmd-name
