codex
The existing CSS already has `.cmd .search-match`, and search filtering is centralized in `useMultiAxisFilter`. I’m going to add a pure highlighter utility, thread the active query through `App -> CommandList -> TaskCommand`, and render highlighted HTML only for the row name and description.
apply patch
